sequenceDiagram
    actor Partner as Partner
    participant cooker as cooker
    participant seshat as seshat
    actor CRON as CRON
    participant adstatistics as adstatistics
    participant Ticker as Ticker (scheduler)
    participant vasscheduler as vasscheduler
    actor Operator as Operator
    participant OperatorTool as OperatorTool (tool)
    participant account as account
    participant Pipeline as Pipeline (infra)
    actor Seller as Seller
    participant frontendplatform as frontendplatform
    participant graphql as graphql
    actor AiAssistant as AiAssistant
    participant nmf_monetization as nmf_monetization
    participant app_manager as app-manager
    actor AwsApiGateway as AwsApiGateway
    participant atlas as atlas
    participant obidoanalytics as obidoanalytics
    participant front as front
    actor ObjectStore as ObjectStore
    participant mobile as mobile
    actor ShaperAgent as ShaperAgent
    participant External as External
    Note over Partner,ShaperAgent: Mercury cooks an advert
    Partner->>cooker: posts an advert
    cooker->>cooker: cooks the advert for its target site
    cooker-)cooker: notifies "sns.mercury-cooked"
    Note over Partner,ShaperAgent: seshat records a Mercury domain event in the transaction ledger
    External->>seshat: sns.mercury-advert-state-changed, sns.mercury-vas-state-changed, sns.mercury-message-received (+1 more) (from cooker)
    seshat->>seshat: writes one row per event
    Note over Partner,ShaperAgent: Rebuild a market's daily statistics [sites: imovirtualpt, otodompl, storiaro] [envs: production]
    CRON->>adstatistics: cron 0 1/2 * * *
    adstatistics->>adstatistics: rebuilds the day's advert facts
    Note over Partner,ShaperAgent: The activation sweep starts due schedules
    Ticker->>vasscheduler: fires the vasscheduler activation sweep
    vasscheduler->>vasscheduler: starts every schedule that is due
    Note over Partner,ShaperAgent: Operator exports agency portfolio values
    Operator->>OperatorTool: runs the portfolio export
    OperatorTool->>account: the agency owner members [backofficeMembersList]
    Note over Partner,ShaperAgent: The pipeline deploys the scheduler
    Pipeline->>vasscheduler: deploys a new vasscheduler build
    vasscheduler->>vasscheduler: warms its schedule cache
    Note over Partner,ShaperAgent: Seller asks the assistant a question
    Seller->>frontendplatform: asks the assistant a question
    frontendplatform->>graphql: stream the answer [assistantStream]
    graphql->>AiAssistant: stream the reply [POST /api/v1/assistant/chat_streaming]
    loop stream
    AiAssistant-->>graphql: streams the reply as META, TOKEN and DONE events
    end
    loop stream
    graphql-->>frontendplatform: streams each event to the client
    end
    frontendplatform->>frontendplatform: appends every TOKEN delta to the message
    Note over Partner,ShaperAgent: nMF republishes a stored money record onto its bus
    External->>nmf_monetization: stream.user_event_store
    nmf_monetization->>nmf_monetization: reads the detail-type off the stored column
    nmf_monetization-)nmf_monetization: notifies one of "nmfbus.FeatureEnabled", "nmfbus.FeatureDisabled", "nmfbus.CreateAutoSchedule" (+1 more)
    Note over Partner,ShaperAgent: Partner manages an API key and an advert
    Partner->>app_manager: opens the integration settings
    app_manager->>AwsApiGateway: create the key and bind it to the plan [CreateApiKey, CreateUsagePlanKey]
    frontendplatform->>atlas: save or delete the advert [postAdvert, putAdvert, deleteAdvert]
    Note over Partner,ShaperAgent: obido analytics refreshes the market structure
    CRON->>obidoanalytics: cron 0 18 * * *
    obidoanalytics->>front: the city, region and developer graph [SQL investment flat city region developer]
    obidoanalytics->>ObjectStore: take the refreshed snapshot [ADDR SNAPSHOT_DESTINATION]
    Note over Partner,ShaperAgent: Seller resumes a selling draft
    Seller->>mobile: resumes a selling draft
    mobile->>graphql: open a selling chat session [agenticSellingStart]
    graphql->>ShaperAgent: initiate the chat [POST /api/v1/assistant/initiate_chat] (inferred)
